        "id": 1352056
      },
      "writtenOn": "2025-07-01T04:20:48Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "That is correct, unfortunately I do not see other way to detect that modular TCSS is connected. Let me check for an alternative, or how tight is the race between reading this pin and reaching S5.",
